@*
    Reusable validation summary partial (design §14.1).

    Renders every ModelState error — including field-level errors mirrored
    from InputValidator — at the top of the page (Requirement 2.12). Uses
    asp-validation-summary="All" so that both model-level and property-level
    errors are surfaced together, matching the "one summary at top plus inline
    per-field" pattern described in design §14.1.
*@
<div asp-validation-summary="All" class="validation-summary" role="alert"></div>
